        "id": "GAP-001",
        "severity": "blocking",
        "sourceId": "story",
        "line": 8,
        "quote": "any equation and plot the graph",
        "message": "The source commits to plotting any equation; clarification specification generation 1, Q-001 identifies four 2D equation families but leaves their syntax and within-family coverage unresolved. The specification explicitly disclaims equation grammar and operator coverage, while REQ-001/AC-001 only require an equation in each family. An implementation limited to one trivial expression per family could satisfy those clauses and the four-form tests while rejecting other equations in those same families, contrary to the source request. Resolve the supported syntax/coverage or explicitly narrow the request before treating this obligation as verifiable."
